=== f642838 Run Agent commands without console windows and show them in the Agent panel
Termior is a GUI-subsystem process, so every console child spawned without
CREATE_NO_WINDOW got its own cmd window. Set the flag on Agent commands and
on the other console helpers (taskkill, git, hooks, agent-host transports,
fsutil, notification PowerShell).

TaskRuntime gains an optional MessageObserver so the Composer receives
assistant tool calls and tool results while a task is still running. The
conversation now renders each tool call as a collapsible block: the command
and its status stay visible, and clicking expands the selectable output
tail (ANSI stripped, capped at 200 lines).

