=== c3440f3 Show download progress, speed and ETA for app updates
The About page only said "Downloading Termior x.y.z…" with no sign of how
far along the installer download was. The platform updater now reports
written bytes through an atomic counter, and the UI polls it every 500 ms
to render a progress bar plus downloaded/total, percent, speed over a
trailing 5 s window, and remaining time.

